{"5421600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"I Swear I Parked Here","steam_appid":5421600,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has been there. You walk out of the store, look across the parking lot and realize you have no idea where your car is.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Swear I Parked Here turns that moment into a game. Your car is somewhere out there, hidden among thousands of others. All you have is your key.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FROM 1,000 CARS TO INFINITY<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start on a lot with 1,000 cars and work your way up to 4,000, 10,000, 20,000 and 50,000. Then comes the final challenge: an endless parking lot that never stops. Beat it to unlock Endless Mode, where you decide how likely it is that your car is anywhere nearby.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADE YOUR SEARCH<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Old-school key: walk up to every single car and try the lock<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Remote key: press the button and watch for the blinking lights, with more range on every upgrade<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Companions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAKE YOUR TIME<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies, no pressure. Just you, your key and an ocean of cars. Each parking lot is generated from its own seed, so no two searches are the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your best times, beat every level and prove that you really did park right here.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has been there. You walk out of the store, look across the parking lot and realize you have no idea where your car is.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Swear I Parked Here turns that moment into a game. Your car is somewhere out there, hidden among thousands of others. All you have is your key.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FROM 1,000 CARS TO INFINITY<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start on a lot with 1,000 cars and work your way up to 4,000, 10,000, 20,000 and 50,000. Then comes the final challenge: an endless parking lot that never stops. Beat it to unlock Endless Mode, where you decide how likely it is that your car is anywhere nearby.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADE YOUR SEARCH<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Old-school key: walk up to every single car and try the lock<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Remote key: press the button and watch for the blinking lights, with more range on every upgrade<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Companions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAKE YOUR TIME<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies, no pressure. Just you, your key and an ocean of cars. Each parking lot is generated from its own seed, so no two searches are the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your best times, beat every level and prove that you really did park right here.<\/p>","short_description":"You swear you parked right here. Now find your car among thousands of identical ones. Start with an old-fashioned key, upgrade to a remote with growing range, take your time and conquer lots with 1,000 to 50,000 cars, and beyond.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5421600\/370b63bb396deef61ce8fce7551f56105dac0b85\/header.jpg?t=1793693117","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5421600\/ee7a82ca3094d02475fb53056d54095660a8208b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793693117","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5421600\/ee7a82ca3094d02475fb53056d54095660a8208b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793693117","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-Core ~2.5 GHz (z. B. Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300)<br><\/li><li><